      "seed": 432470111,
      "version": 774,
      "versionNonce": 628367921,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780578778410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- When the user clicks on retry manually, the retries value is patched and the time of\n the operation is saved (last_manual_retry_at).\n- If the server is still unhealthy we update the status back to unhealthy and set the\nretry_at to 30/60 mins. We do this until the server is back up.\n- We ensure the user receives ONLY 1 notification, the first time the server goes down. \nUntil it's back up again - No duplicate notifications should be sent. We do this by checking notification_sent.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- When the user clicks on retry manually, the retries value is patched and the time of\n the operation is saved (last_manual_retry_at).\n- If the server is still unhealthy we update the status back to unhealthy and set the\nretry_at to 30/60 mins. We do this until the server is back up.\n- We ensure the user receives ONLY 1 notification, the first time the server goes down. \nUntil it's back up again - No duplicate notifications should be sent. We do this by checking notification_sent.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
